# SDD: Migration Acceptance
status: draft
authority: migration-acceptance

## Release gates
- Complete source inventory.
- All parity rows VERIFIED or approved INTENTIONAL_DIFFERENCE.
- Native `.cronus` examples for migrated capabilities.
- No React/Next/Node runtime requirement.
- Semantic token/theme system verified.
- Component waves 0–4 verified.
- Interactive keyboard behavior verified.
- Accessibility checks green.
- Theme/light/dark/runtime override behavior green.
- Existing kernel tests and demos remain green.
- One documented harness command reproduces verification.
- `LANGUAGE.md` matches reality.
- FINAL-REPORT contains counts and evidence.

## Completion rule
No qualitative "mostly done". Use measurable counts.
